EXACT = {}
def exact(name, prose, *places):
    EXACT[name.casefold()] = (prose, list(places))

exact('The World Storehouse', 'Broad storage bays recede across a plain floor, their unadorned surfaces giving this repository a scale beyond any ordinary shop. The open floor is kept clear among the bays.')
exact('The Dreamheart', "The dream folds inward around a `cpale, wavering center`x. Half-formed colors gather there and slip apart, like memories losing the names of the people in them. Nothing quite becomes a wall or a horizon. It's the still point of an unfinished thought, with all the surrounding strangeness leaning toward it.")
exact('Yggdrasil', 'The `gWorld Tree`x rises beyond any comfortable measure of height. Roots shoulder out of the earth like wooded ridges, their bark furrowed deeply enough to hold whole drifts of fallen leaves. Above, the branches divide and divide again until the crown resembles another landscape, suspended beyond reach.')
exact('the steel mill', 'Heavy steel framing spans broad industrial floors. Repeated supports and worn concrete divide the mill into immense working bays, with rust collecting at joints and handling scars crossing the open ground.')
exact('the Cortex Academy of Civic Integration Biodome', 'Curving structural ribs divide the biodome enclosure above cultivated ground. Beds of vegetation occupy the space within the framework, their irregular leaves set against the deliberate geometry of the `wdomed shell`x.')
exact('Cortex Academy of Civic Integration Biodome', EXACT['the cortex academy of civic integration biodome'][0])
exact('Moore Woods', 'Old leaves lie thick beneath the `gtrees of Moore Woods`x, their dry upper layers hiding dark, crumbling mold. Lichen mottles the trunks above a tangle of roots and fallen limbs. The view closes after only a little distance, broken into strips of bark and the soft clutter of growth.')
exact("Warden's Wood", "Close ranks of old `gtrees`x enclose Warden's Wood. Roots push through the leaf litter like the knuckles of buried hands, and moss softens the fallen timber between them. The woodland smells of damp bark. Every gap opens onto another trunk, giving the forest a watchfulness that never quite resolves into a watcher.")
exact('Deadwood', 'Pale, broken limbs crowd the dark floor of `wDeadwood`x. Standing trunks shed strips of weathered bark, exposing grain the color of old bone. Splinters catch in the leaf litter, and the dry smell of decaying timber hangs between the trees. New growth threads quietly through what the older woodland has left behind.')
exact('Blackmoon Woods', 'Dark trunks crowd the tangled ground of `gBlackmoon Woods`x. Roots vanish beneath thorny growth and rise again a few paces farther on, making the forest floor difficult to read. Overlapping branches divide the distance into deep pockets. The air smells of leaf mold, with a bitter trace from bruised green stems.')
exact('Arkwright Cemetery', 'Lichen freckles the `wheadstones`x of Arkwright Cemetery, filling the shallow cuts of weathered names. Grass presses against the bases, and older markers lean by almost imperceptible degrees. The rows keep a solemn order despite the slow work of roots and time, leaving measured spaces for the living to pass between the dead.')
exact('the Arkwright Mausoleum', 'Heavy stone shuts the mausoleum around a small central space. Dust lies in the joints of the memorial surfaces, and age has softened the sharper edges of the masonry. The cool, mineral air holds no trace of domestic life. Here, even an ordinary shift of weight sounds like an interruption.')
exact('Gravesend Bay', 'Broad folds of `cwater`x cross Gravesend Bay, breaking reflected shapes into long, wavering fragments. The open reach keeps a deeper color beyond the nearest ripples. Salt hangs in the air, and the overlapping movement conceals the contours of the bay beneath a surface that never settles long enough to read.')
exact('Willow Cove', "A sheltered crescent of `ysand`x gives Willow Cove a close, quiet scale. Shell chips and tiny pebbles collect in shallow bands, their pale edges worn smooth. Finer grains soften older impressions between them. It's a shore of small details, where the curve of the cove keeps the open coast from feeling quite so vast.")
exact('Sidney Beach', "The `ysand of Sidney Beach`x spreads in broad, low ridges, pale shell fragments scattered among the grains. Passing feet have compressed narrow stretches into firmer ground, but the edges already look loose and uncertain. There's little enclosure here, only the exposed shore and the faint salt smell caught close to the sand.")
exact('Underlook Beach', 'Coarse `ysand`x and dark pebbles give Underlook Beach a rough, speckled surface. Worn shell pieces hide among the stones, and finer grains collect in the shallow hollows between them. The shore has a scraped, weathered look, with older tracks surviving as little more than softer patches in the gritty ground.')
exact('Badwater Park', "Worn patches break the `ggrass`x of Badwater Park into uneven islands. Tough weeds thrive along the margins, and old stems form a dry thatch beneath the greener blades. It's a neighborhood green with the polish rubbed off: open ground, stubborn growth, and room for company to make a little use of both.")
exact("Rosie's Diner", "Chrome edging curls around the long `wcounter`x at Rosie's, dulled where elbows have rested through countless cups of coffee. Upholstered `wbooths`x make snug alcoves beside the dining floor. The room smells of old coffee and the faint sweetness of syrup, with scuffs between the seats tracing the diner's familiar little journeys.", ('counter', "The counter's edge has been polished smooth by resting hands. Small scratches cloud the top, leaving a comfortable shared surface for leaning in to talk or examining something laid between companions."), ('booths', "Upholstered benches face across compact tables, their cushions softened along the most-used places. The raised backs shelter each group from the room's wider bustle, making a small pocket for close conversation."))
exact('the mayor\'s office', "A broad `wdesk`x gives the mayor's office a clear center of authority. The visitor chairs face a surface rubbed smooth at the working edge, while carefully finished wood lends the room a dry polish smell. Small marks of use survive beneath the formality, reminders that decisions here are still made at an ordinary conversational distance.", ('desk', "The working edge of the desk is smooth beneath the hands, with fine scratches crossing the surface. A visitor's chair faces it at an easy speaking distance, leaving the desktop between the two sides of a conversation."))
exact('the planetarium', 'The dome curves over rows of `wviewing seats`x, leaving few straight lines for the eye to settle on. Upholstery muffles the small sounds of company getting comfortable. Even between presentations, the room turns attention upward, where the great enclosed sweep has the waiting emptiness of a sky before the first stars appear.', ('viewing seats', 'The seats tip attention toward the planetarium dome. Padded backs and worn armrests make room to settle in, with the broad viewing space held comfortably above the seated company.'))
exact('the Bowling Lanes of The Alley', 'Long, polished lanes draw parallel lines through The Alley. Fine marks cross the approaches, and the wood carries a faint, waxy smell beneath the trace of well-used footwear. The `wsofa`x sits behind the lanes, close enough for companions to watch a turn and make their opinions comfortably known.', ('sofa', "Deep cushions settle into familiar hollows along the sofa. The arms are rubbed smooth, and the upholstery holds a faint fabric warmth; there's room to sit close or claim a comfortable corner."))
exact('the Arcade Hall of The Alley', "Arcade cabinets crowd The Alley's game hall in rows of bold artwork and rubbed edges. Finger marks have dulled the most handled panels, while dust finds narrow seams between the machines. The central aisle leaves room for company to hover behind a player, surrounded by the bright promises of the cabinet faces.")
exact('the Beelzebubbles Laundromat', 'Round-fronted machines line Beelzebubbles like a row of blunt, glassy eyes. Irreverent decoration competes with the scuffs on the walls, and the air smells thickly of detergent and warm fabric. A long `wfolding counter`x cuts through the clutter, the surface smooth enough to sort a load or lean across for gossip.', ('folding counter', 'The broad counter smells faintly of clean fabric and detergent. The finish is smooth enough for folding, with a long clear edge where companions can lean while sorting a load or sharing the latest gossip.'))
exact('the lighthouse stairs', "The lighthouse stairs curl tightly inside the masonry. Countless climbs have worn hollows into the treads, leaving dust in the angles beyond a shoe's reach. The stone carries a cool mineral smell, and each movement acquires a short echo as the stair winds around the same enclosing wall.")
exact('the beacon', "Glass and metal gather around the lighthouse beacon's central housing. Fine ridges in the optical assembly catch stray reflections, breaking nearby shapes into slivers. Dust lies in the less accessible joints. The standing space feels cramped beside the apparatus, a small human margin around something built to be seen far away.")
exact('the old gallows', "The `wgallows`x rise in blunt, weathered timbers above a scarred platform. Age cracks run deep along the grain, and the most exposed edges have silvered. There's nothing ornamental about the frame. The bare wood and open space beneath it leave the purpose of the structure horribly easy to imagine.")
exact('the waters of life', "The `cwaters of life`x have a clarity that makes distance difficult to trust. Nearer ripples pass over depths that look almost within reach, then recede beyond any sensible measure. It's a beautiful, disquieting expanse, with no solid surface to interrupt the layered water or give the eye a dependable scale.")
exact('the center of Rhagost', "Heavy, time-worn surfaces gather around Rhagost's central space. The scale feels built for a settlement larger than the immediate gathering area, with the `wopen center`x giving the surrounding mass a point of reference.")
exact('the Mobious path', "The `wpath`x repeats with the stubborn familiarity of a dream revisited. A worn patch of ground, a bend in the enclosing shapes, another stretch that seems already passed: none offers a reliable landmark. It's all perfectly visible at close range, yet difficult to place in a sequence that makes sense.")
exact('the Goblin Market\'s Library', "Books crowd the Goblin Market's shelves in mismatched ranks. Some bindings look waxy, others fibrous; the gaps between them carry a dry, peculiar smell that ordinary paper doesn't quite explain. A `wreading table`x makes a small island of order among the volumes, though even the straightest stacks lean a little toward their neighbors.", ('reading table', 'Broad enough for open books, the table keeps a clear working surface among the shelves. Fine scratches and a dull polish mark the places where readers have leaned, with chairs close enough to compare a passage in low voices.'))
exact('the Fleshforming Clinic', "Smooth treatment surfaces interrupt the Goblin Market's rough construction with an almost offensive cleanliness. The `wconsultation chairs`x faces fittings rubbed free of every casual stain. Around that precise little island, the enclosure keeps the market's uneven grain, making the clinic look less comforting than carefully prepared.", ('consultation chairs', 'Closely placed chairs face the consultation setting. Their spacing encourages a quieter voice, with a little room between the seats for company to turn toward one another without entering the working space.'))
exact('Arcane Dueling Circle', 'Circular markings define the `wdueling ground`x, their lines interrupted by old scuffs. Near the middle, repeated contests have worn a duller patch into the surface. The circle edge leaves observers room to gather, with the marked boundary making every step into the open ground feel deliberate.')
exact('the Alchemical Labratory', "Fixed racks crowd the laboratory's working surfaces. Old spills have left overlapping stains that cleaning has faded without erasing, and a sharp, mineral smell clings to the fittings. The `wworkbench`x keeps a clear station among them, bringing the room's strange experiments down to the scale of careful hands.", ('workbench', 'Fine tool marks cross the stout working surface, with dust caught in the deepest cuts. The bench stands at a practical height for leaning over a piece of work, bringing careful hands and curious company together.'))
exact('the Magical Workshop', 'Inscribed surfaces border the workshop, their elaborate patterns interrupted by ordinary scratches and old repairs. Fine dust settles into the deeper cuts. A central `wworktable`x gives arcane craft a practical meeting place, with enough room for company to lean together over work that has required both patience and precision.', ('worktable', 'A broad working surface bears fine cuts, stains, and older repairs. The edge is rubbed smooth where people lean over a project, with enough room for companions to examine the same detail from either side.'))
exact('the Engineering Workshop', 'Metal brackets and squared surfaces give the workshop a stubbornly practical geometry. Filing marks cloud the edges of the `wworkbench`x, and fine debris catches in the joints despite repeated cleanups. The air carries a dry metal smell, with each worn station recording the small adjustments of things made to fit.', ('workbench', 'Fine tool marks cross the stout working surface, with dust caught in the deepest cuts. The bench stands at a practical height for leaning over a piece of work, bringing careful hands and curious company together.'))
exact('the Folly', 'Mismatched woodwork and patched furnishings make the Folly feel assembled through a succession of small rescues. Old finishes meet without quite agreeing in color. A pair of `wcorner seats`x tucks against the irregular wall, the seats close enough for low conversation over the faint smells of fabric, dust, and familiar timber.', ('corner seats', 'These seats tuck into a quieter corner, angled toward one another. The fabric is softened by use, and the close arrangement makes it easy to lower a voice without losing sight of the room.'))
exact('the Court room', "The room's formal arrangement faces the raised judicial area. `wPublic benches`x stand in orderly rows, with clear floor separating the observers from the focus of proceedings.", ('public benches', 'Rows of substantial benches face the judicial area. Their seats and upper rails are smoothed by years of waiting, with enough space for neighboring spectators to exchange a quiet remark.'))
exact('the crematorium', "Heat has darkened the masonry around heavy furnace housings. Metal edges carry the dull wear of repeated handling, while fine residue catches in joints beyond an ordinary cleaning. The open floor remains starkly clear before the machinery. It's an orderly room, made more severe by how little the surroundings leave to explain.")
exact('a room full of body drawers', "Banks of metal-fronted body compartments line the morgue. Small handles repeat along the walls with a precision made uneasy by their purpose. A narrow central aisle divides the ranks, smelling faintly of cleaned metal. Scuffs on the floor provide almost the only irregularity in the room's measured arrangement.")
exact('a room full of clocks', 'Clock faces crowd the walls in overlapping circles, their numerals differing in size and style. Brass-colored edges sit beside darker cases, and fine dust gathers on the smallest ledges. The central floor feels almost accidental within this accumulation of measured time, a patch of room the clocks have yet to claim.')
exact('the Cortex Academy of Civic Integration Biodome airlock', 'Close metal panels enclose a compact transition chamber. Hard seals and repeated structural seams distinguish the airlock from the planted environment it serves.')
exact('the Gravesend History Museum - Prehistoric Gravesend', "Earth-toned display panels and stone-textured mounts organize this gallery around Gravesend's distant past. The viewing area leaves room to pause before the exhibits without crowding their edges.")
exact('the Gravesend History Museum - The Duncan Foundation', 'Formal display groupings present the Duncan Foundation within a restrained gallery. The viewing area is arranged for close attention to the exhibit panels and their careful sequence.')
exact('the Gravesend Historical Museum - Maritime Trade & Commerce', "Maritime display motifs and carefully separated exhibits trace the town's relationship with shipping. The viewing area allows the gallery's rope, wood, and hull-shaped details to be taken in at a measured pace.")
exact('the Gravesend Historical Museum - The Founding of Gravesend', "A sequence of historical panels gives this gallery a deliberate narrative shape. The viewing area faces displays devoted to Gravesend's beginnings, with restrained finishes keeping attention on the material presented.")
exact('the Gravesend History Museum - Modern Day Gravesend', "Contemporary display panels organize the gallery around the town's more recent identity. Clean edges frame the exhibits, with a viewing area allowing visitors to pause over the details.")
exact('the Gravesend History Museum - The Aquarium', 'Thick viewing panels separate the gallery from the water-filled displays. Their layered reflections give the room an unusual depth, with a viewing area set back from the glass.')

# Additional functions used by the civic, agricultural, dream, and travel maps.
rule(r'\b(?:park|farmland|green|valley|hills|hill|crop|cornfield|potato|tomato|carrot)\b', 'Low growth covers the worked and open ground. Soil shows between the plants, with the uneven texture of stems and leaves defining the surface.')
rule(r'\b(?:lot|rubble|ruins|remains|ruined|burnt|shattered)\b', 'Broken remnants interrupt a rough expanse of ground. Grit fills the gaps between larger fragments, and weather has dulled the exposed edges to similar shades. Older shapes remain just legible beneath the debris, giving the place the unsettled appearance of something interrupted and left to wear away.')
rule(r'\b(?:stables?|barn|hen house|pig pen|chicken run|row of stalls|grain silo)\b', 'Worn timber and practical partitions enclose a close agricultural space. Straw catches along the lower edges, mingling with the rich, earthy smell of old bedding. The clearest ground follows the working route between the fittings, rubbed bare by the repeated chores of tending the enclosure.')
rule(r'channel', 'Water occupies a narrow channel, the surface caught between enclosing banks. Silt traces soft lines along the margins, gathering in sheltered pockets. Small disturbances travel along the confined reach before fading into the overlapping patterns farther away.')
rule(r'dumpster|dumpsters', 'Dented refuse containers crowd a stained patch of ground. Old runoff has dried in dark fans beneath them, and stray scraps catch against the lower edges. The sour smell of discarded things lingers stubbornly here, even where the surrounding surface has been swept clear.')
rule(r'fence|railing', 'A boundary of repeated uprights divides the space. Weather has picked at the joints, while the most handled sections show a smoother, darker wear. Grit collects along the base, tracing the line between the well-used ground and the less disturbed surface beyond it.')
rule(r'baseball|first base|second base|third base|home base|foul line|pitcher|short stop|dash (?:to|home)|athletics|sport facilities|basketball|volleyball|skating|ice rink', 'The playing surface opens between the boundaries of the sporting ground. Repeated use has marked familiar lines of movement, with the busiest patches showing the deepest wear. The sidelines provide a shared vantage point, close enough to follow a game without crowding the field of play.')
rule(r'\b(?:massage|spa|beauty|treatment)\b', 'Muted colors surround the treatment space, carrying a faint trace of clean fabric and scented preparations. Small divisions give the room a private scale. A padded `wchaise`x sits at the margin, with room to settle away from the central working area and let the ordinary pace of movement slow.', ('chaise', "A padded chaise follows the length of the body, the upholstery softly creased from use. The raised end offers a comfortable place to rest a shoulder, with the treatment room's activity set slightly apart."))
rule(r'\b(?:art room|colour palette|smash room|repair|workplace)\b', 'Fine marks of work cover the `wworktable`x, layering careful scratches over older stains. The surrounding surfaces hold the dry smell of materials handled and set aside. Clear patches among the working areas leave room for company to examine a project without crowding the hands doing it.', ('worktable', 'A broad working surface bears fine cuts, stains, and older repairs. The edge is rubbed smooth where people lean over a project, with enough room for companions to examine the same detail from either side.'))
rule(r'book nook|children.s corner|comics section|librarian.s desk', 'Close shelves gather around a `warmchair`x, their contents making uneven bands of color. Paper lends the corner a dry, familiar smell. From the seat, the larger room gives way to the small scale of bindings, pages, and whatever has been brought here to read.', ('armchair', "The armchair's cushions have settled into a comfortable hollow. Worn arms support an elbow or an open book, and the fabric softens the small sounds of shifting into a more comfortable position."))
rule(r'arcade|pool tables|jungle gym|winding tubes|tube slide|playground', 'The recreation fittings break the space into bright details and worn edges. Years of repeated use have polished the nearest surfaces while leaving dust in the awkward corners. A gathering area sits clear of the activity space, giving companions somewhere to pause and watch between turns.')
rule(r'\b(?:breakroom|break room|community room|leisure hub|vip|v\.i\.p|private area|brothel|bordello|club|the dive|lodge)\b', 'Comfortable seats gather into a `wsofa`x, with a little room left between the furniture for passing company. The upholstery carries the faint smell of fabric warmed by use. Small worn patches lend the interior the easy familiarity of a place where people settle without ceremony.', ('sofa', "Deep cushions settle into familiar hollows along the sofa. The arms are rubbed smooth, and the upholstery holds a faint fabric warmth; there's room to sit close or claim a comfortable corner."))
rule(r'\b(?:hall|halls|passage|second floor|third floor|mezzanine|antechamber|east end|west end|wing|wings)\b', "A worn strip of floor carries passage through the building's interior. Old scuffs cluster along the lower walls, with repairs showing as slightly different shades in the finish. Voices and footsteps travel readily through the plain space, reaching farther than a casual glance.")
